{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261AJmv2a3ie1795486157.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日天氣提提你：<br/></p><p>與冷鋒相關的強烈東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。本港今早多處地區氣溫較昨日低三至四度。<br/><br/>本港地區今日天氣預測:<br/>大致多雲，有一兩陣雨。天氣稍涼，今晚市區氣溫下降至最低約19度，新界再低兩三度。吹和緩至清勁偏北風，離岸及高地吹強風。<br/><br/>展望: 未來一兩日早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16度左右，新界再低兩三度。本週後期天色逐漸好轉，氣溫回升，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p><p></p><p>今日天氣預告由專治屙嘔肚痛嘅李萬山脾胃丸帶俾你。</p><p></p><p>09:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:23:55.708331+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T22:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:14.240041+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:17:19.744461+00:00","content_hash":"a15ac38f7c7cb1c06f85a863ad87ab11b0c70e7a023aa46a8d517c3d7588a492","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:23:55.708331+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}